        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Akhang Jisu kage naimei thay e,",
            "Ryanra ganv khou Kakumhmei",
            "Pam maek ge;",
            "Jisu akhang Kata ai laa tow the,",
            "Gaanv saekc khang kage maek sihni akhang kage nai.",
            "",
            "Jisu akhang, Jisu akhang,",
            "Kage nai e, tingmik ’thuic;",
            "Ting-neih suh khou kage nai,",
            "Pwanzingh guang khou kage nai,",
            "Tingmik ’thuic achaenglwan khou",
            "Jisu kage nai.",
            "",
            "2 Jisu akhang, Kamei hei aPam e,",
            "Apanty chaeng zinghmei khou zaylou khang;",
            "Zauczihmei {:1 ata rairiu pwkhou",
            "Araana ngam mak zaeng {:1 Kata kage nai e.",
            "",
            "3 Ai ringc bam saanv Jisu kage nai e,",
            "Kamei na hei paapc mei nunc Pa kiu e;",
            "Pam baihmei maek, Kakumc kalaih makmei,",
            "Zianthaymei, tanhmei, kalingmei Pam Jisu na de."
          ]
        }
      },
